// Peer protocol between the two servers of a Leasorix HA relationship.
//
// Both servers run the Peer service and call the partner's service: every
// server pushes its own lease changes and heartbeats; the configuration
// leader additionally pushes configuration snapshots. The transport is gRPC
// over TLS, authenticated either by mutual TLS or by a shared secret bound
// to the TLS channel (see internal/ha/transport.go).

